            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.178649237472767,
            "y": 12.910611231371064,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Geographical Location and Occupation</strong><br>\nThe West Bank is a region in the Middle East that has been largely occupied by Israel since 1967. It is located west of the Jordan River and shares its borders with Israel and Jordan. The occupation has influenced both the political and the daily dynamics of the region.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Political Control</strong><br>\nPolitical control in the West Bank is complicated. While the Palestinian Authority manages some areas, Israel remains dominant in other areas, especially those where settlements are located. This political division significantly affects the daily lives of the people.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Settlements and Settlers</strong><br>\nIsraeli settlements are communities built by Israelis in the West Bank. The presence of these settlements and settlers often leads to tensions and conflicts with the Palestinian residents, and affects their access to land and resources.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          }
        ],
        "slideBackgroundSelector": {}
      },
      {
        "elements": [
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 4.415011037527593,
            "width": 37.98882681564246,
            "height": 8.830022075055187,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><span style=\"font-size:1.5em;\"><strong>INFORMATION TEXT (Part 2)</strong></span></p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "55aaf4d3-f7e3-4a3e-9196-01a6f7474f94"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582782,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Freedom of Movement</strong><br>\nFreedom of movement in the West Bank is restricted by checkpoints, roadblocks, and the wall between Israel and the West Bank. This impairs people's ability to get to work, receive medical care, and visit family.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Economic Situation</strong><br>\nThe economic situation in the West Bank is difficult, with high unemployment and dependency on foreign aid. The occupation and restrictions on freedom of movement hinder trade and economic development.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Education and Culture</strong><br>\nDespite the challenges, the residents of the West Bank place great value on education and culture. Schools and universities are active, and there is a rich tradition of music, dance, and art that persists despite the political circumstances.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "3b13867b-feab-4e2e-bfa2-fcc82e4dbff1"
            },
