            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Healthcare</strong><br>\nHealthcare in the West Bank can be challenging, especially in areas controlled by Israel. Access to medical facilities and services is often restricted, and there is a shortage of medical personnel and equipment.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Daily Challenges</strong><br>\nThe daily challenges for the people in the West Bank are diverse and range from restrictions on freedom of movement to a lack of basic services. Political uncertainty and ongoing occupation significantly burden daily life.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Hope and Resistance</strong><br>\nDespite the difficult circumstances, many residents of the West Bank show hope and resistance. They work for a better future and engage in community projects to improve life in their region.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
